    "**Tip 1** There are only global teleports on the map and only to the bonfires. So you can defend any spot for very long time.**": {
        "chi": "**Tip 1** 地图上全程只有篝火远程传送。所以你可以在很多地方进行长时间守点.**"
    },
    "**Tip 2 **If you saw a long chain you can climb on it**": {
        "chi": "**Tip 2 **如果你看到一条长锁链，你可以爬上去**"
    },
    "**Tip 3 **All the items have limited ammount of uses but have low cooldown time**": {
        "chi": "**Tip 3 **所有物品的使用数量有限，但冷却时间较短 **"
    },
    "**Tip 4 **You can refill the item charges by using Ash Estus Flask**": {
        "chi": "**Tip 4 **您可以使用 元素灰瓶 补充物品费用**"
    },
    "**Tip 5 **Some items can be used on bosses**": {
        "chi": "**Tip 5 **雷枪，灵魂巨箭，黑之球，白龙吐息可作用于boss**"
    },
    "**Tip 6 **The Green Blossom will help you with dodging boulders and axes**": {
        "chi": "**Tip 6 **绿化草将帮助你躲避巨石和巨斧**"
    },
    "**Tip 7 **Watch out for hidden traps when you are in Sens Fortress**": {
        "chi": "**Tip 7 **在进入塞恩古堡时，小心隐藏的陷阱**"
    },
    "**Tip 8 **There are illisionary walls that can have hidden items in. To destroy them press E near those walls**": {
        "chi": "**Tip 8 **有薛定谔之墙可以隐藏物品。要摧毁它们，请按靠近墙壁的E键 **"
    },
    "**Tip 9 **There are Fire Keeper Souls being spread on the map. If you get all of them you can power up your bonfires**": {
        "chi": "**Tip 9 **地图上有火之守卫的灵魂散落在各处。如果你把它们都得到，你就可以点燃篝火了**"
    },
    "**Tip 10 **You can find out the item class you have by the color of the parchment on your picture**": {
        "chi": "**Tip 10 **你可以通过图片上的颜色找到你的神器类别**"
    },
    "**Tip 11 **Never rush and hurry. If you do not know the map just stay cover and defend with your teamates**": {
        "chi": "**Tip 11 **不要乱跑。如果你不人事地图，就聚集起来，和你的队友一起防守**"
    },
