    "**The Stray Demon was keeping an eye for no one undead leaves the prison..**": {
        "chi": "**离群的恶魔一直在监视有没有亡灵离开监狱。。**"
    },
    "**..Only the Old Witch had the right to take away the undead to Sens Fortress for their experiments. But there were exceptions.**": {
        "chi": "**..只有老巫婆有权将亡灵带到森斯要塞进行实验。但也有例外.**"
