    "**The Stray Demon was defeated**": {
        "chi": "**离群的恶魔已被击败**"
    },
    "**The Old Witch is defeated**": {
        "chi": "**老巫婆已被击败**"
    },
    "**At the request of Gwyndolin the Old Witch was selecting the most powerful undead that can keep the flame in price of their lives...**": {
        "chi": "**应葛温德琳的请求，老巫婆选择了最强大的不死生物，他们可以用生命的代价来保存火焰。。。**"
    },
    "**...But one day the Witch completely lost her mind and began to experiment on the undead.**": {
        "chi": "**...但有一天，女巫完全失去了理智，开始对亡灵进行实验.**"
    },
    "**The Iron Golem is defeated. Get to the middle of arena**": {
        "chi": "**钢铁巨偶被击败。到达竞技场中央**"
    },
    "**The Iron Golem was created by the gods to protect Anor Londo from the undead and other demons appeared with a mysterious mist..**": {
        "chi": "**钢铁巨偶是众神为了保护太阳之城免受不死生物的伤害而创造的，其他恶魔也出现在神秘的雾中..**"
    },
    "**..He killed many heroes on the way to the City of the Gods.**": {
        "chi": "**..他在前往众神之城的路上杀死了许多英雄.**"
